//= - Variable in use: bros_q (max 1)
//= Doomed Swords Part 2:
//= - Continuation of the Comodo Quest
//= - Part 1: Found in Quests_Comodo.txt
//= - Part 3: Found in Doomed_Swords.txt
//= - Variable in use dmdswrd_Q (Max 45)
